# gpt5-mini-fast

Use when:
- Multi-tool dispatch where each call should be cheap
- Latency-sensitive interactive UX
- Reasoning depth is not the bottleneck

Avoid when:
- Long single-shot reasoning (use `opus-thinking` instead)
- Function-calling against unknown tools (model lacks tool-use coverage)
